# Cloudflare Pages headers (also works on Netlify via a plugin or manual config).
# Basic hardening; no COOP/COEP needed because the app ships the single-threaded
# ffmpeg.wasm core (no SharedArrayBuffer). See README "Threading tradeoff" if
# you swap in @ffmpeg/core-mt.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()

/public/vendor/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
